# Welcome to <%= @ctx.app_name %>

This site was generated with **Creestal** — a static site generator written in Crystal.

The pages here are the scaffold itself. Each one explains a concept by being a live example of it.

## Quick start

```sh
creestal new my-site   # scaffold a new site
cd my-site
creestal serve         # serve locally with live-reload at http://localhost:3000
creestal build         # build into <%= @ctx.source %>/../out/
```

